DepositAllTip: Coins go to the Piggy Bank first, including the coin slots
BankOnlyTip: Deposit coins to the Piggy Bank, except hotbar and favorites
BankOnlyTip2: Coin slots included; nowhere nearby for the rest
Banked: Coins went to the Piggy Bank
BankedRestStays: Coins banked; nowhere for the rest
BankFullRestStays: Piggy Bank full; the rest stays with you
StoredBanked: Stored nearby, coins in the Piggy Bank
StoredBankFull: Stored nearby; the Piggy Bank is full
LeftBanked: Coins in the Piggy Bank; {0} left
LeftBankFull: No room anywhere: {0} left
